--! A test platform that makes Web Storage fail, each way no program can
--! arrange by itself (`boundary.md` §4.1, §9.8.10 (b)).

--| From now on, `setItem` throws a `QuotaExceededError`.
pub foreign impure fillQuota : () -> ()


--| From now on, reading `sessionStorage` throws a `SecurityError`.
pub foreign impure blockSession : () -> ()


--| From now on, `setItem` throws a `TypeError`, which no standard
--| documents for it.
pub foreign impure breakStorage : () -> ()
